Description: restrained native motion for the DhampirOS desktop
 Provides a session-owned local Wayland wallpaper underlay for LXQt/labwc,
 preserving PCManFM desktop icons and static fallback artwork. Includes
 Full, Reduced and Off preferences and animated/still cursor selection.
 Does not alter authentication, boot policy or system security settings.
